## Environment setup, only if rebuilding the Python environment

The current `venv` already has these dependencies. For a fresh environment:

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
./venv/bin/python -m pip install ezdxf svgwrite svgpathtools cairosvg pyyaml \
  -r requirements-reconstruction.txt
```

CMake also requires the installed C++ dependencies: CGAL, Boost, Qt and yaml-cpp.

## Physical scale and geographic reference

The DXF declares inches. At the selected layers, 3% padding and 1000-pixel raster,
resolution is approximately **0.058644 m/pixel**. Recalculate it if those inputs change.
The configured geographic origin remains an example. Override it with surveyed
values using `--root-lat`, `--root-lon`, `--root-pixel-x`, and `--root-pixel-y` when needed.
